            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "melb03"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious! I followed the directions almost exactly but added baby bella mushrooms and red bell pepper and omitted the salt. I also simmered for about 2 hours which definitely made the stock much more flavorful.",
            "datePublished": "2017-05-08T22:54:15.993Z"
          },
          {
