            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "StaceyD"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great recipe. I had some tired looking veggies so I just used those. In addition to the listed veggies, I had zucchini, yellow squash and red bell pepper. I also roasted everything per other reviewers. I pressure canned it in quart containers. So now I have shelf stable veggie stock. Thanks for this great recipe. I never thought to can vegetable stock before.",
            "datePublished": "2015-06-14T14:24:09.327Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
