            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "DizzyPop2549"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made it. I winged it. Added a head of cabbage, head of garlic, large bunch of spinach, whole bunch of celery, 4 jalapenos, and a large dash of cayenne pepper. doubled the herbs and salt. We ate the pulse, and it was delicious! The stock was just as good.",
            "datePublished": "2023-04-26T05:16:23.594Z"
          },
          {
