            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "David King"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I included several additions: one cup of leftover roasted vegetables parenthesis yellow squash zucchini and onion”, and auto, cloves, tarragon, red pepper flakes, Oregano sage and dried chili peppers. I also cheated by adding a little mesquite smoke flavor. Came out delicious! A little bit sweet,, savory, and hot, with a hint of a smoky finish. I made this to be the stock to be added to a roux for a chicken pot pie I’ll make for dinner!",
            "datePublished": "2020-05-08T17:56:40.443Z"
